#: weathermap-cacti-plugin-editor.php
msgid ""
"<p><strong>Bandwidth:</strong> Set the capacity used to calculate utilisation, for example 100M or 1G. K, M, G and T are supported. Select Same As &quot;In&quot; when both directions have equal capacity.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Traffic interface:</strong> Search by device, port or description, or select Browse all. Choose an interface, then click Use interface to set the primary measured source, click destination and main hover graph. Additional measured sources and hover graphs are kept.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Appearance and comments:</strong> Via Style controls curved or angled bends; Link Width controls arrow thickness. IN Comment and OUT Comment add text along each direction. The percentage sets the text position along the link. Comment Style places comments beside the link (Edge) or over the arrow (Centre); Use map default follows Map Style.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Additional hover graphs:</strong> Show a maximum of two hover graphs: the main traffic graph and one extra, such as CPU, latency or another interface. Filter by graph type narrows the choices. Add hover graph adds the extra; Replace hover graphs changes it; Remove graph removes it. The main traffic graph, measured traffic and link click destination stay unchanged. In the viewer, each Cacti preview opens its own full graph when clicked.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Advanced settings:</strong> Optional controls for moving the IN/OUT traffic labels, combining measured sources, changing the click destination and entering custom hover image URLs. Traffic label positions move the utilisation boxes along the link, independently of comment positions. Use map default follows Map Style. A normal traffic link usually needs no changes here.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Combining traffic sources:</strong> Add traffic source adds another interface to the map total, separately for IN and OUT. Remove source removes an additional source. Change the primary source using Use interface at the top. The combined traffic is compared with the configured bandwidth to calculate utilisation. No combined Cacti graph is created automatically; create a matching aggregate graph in Cacti and enter its click and hover URLs if needed. Separate map links are usually clearer for primary and backup connections.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Manual sources and URLs:</strong> The source text box edits the complete measured-source list, including the primary source. Click destination URL controls where clicking the map link goes. Main hover graph URL sets the first preview; Additional graph URL(s) accepts one extra image URL. This extra is also managed under Additional hover graphs.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Tidy and Via:</strong> Tidy adjusts the link layout. Via lets you place a bend point on the map.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Edit Raw Configuration:</strong> Edit the underlying map syntax for settings beyond this form.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>Umkhawulokudonsa:</strong> Setha umthamo osetshenziswa ukubala ukusetshenziswa, isibonelo 100M noma 1G. K, M, G no-T ziyasekelwa. Khetha Okufanayo ne-&quot;In&quot; uma zombili izinkomba zinomthamo olinganayo.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Isixhumi sethrafikhi:</strong> Sesha ngedivayisi, imbobo noma incazelo, noma khetha u-Phequlula konke. Khetha isixhumi, bese uchofoza u-Sebenzisa isixhumi ukuze usethe umthombo oyinhloko okaliwe, indawo yokuchofoza negrafu eyinhloko yokubuka phezu. Imithombo eyengeziwe ekaliwe namagrafu okubuka phezu kuyagcinwa.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Ukubukeka namazwana:</strong> Isitayela Sokudlula silawula ukugoba okugobile noma okunamakhona; Ububanzi Besixhumanisi bulawula ukushuba komcibisholo. Amazwana e-IN namazwana e-OUT engeza umbhalo ehlangothini ngalunye. Iphesenti lisetha indawo yombhalo esixhumanisini. Isitayela Samazwana sibeka amazwana eceleni kwesixhumanisi (Eceleni) noma phezu komcibisholo (Phakathi nendawo); u-Sebenzisa okuzenzakalelayo kwemephu ulandela Isitayela Semephu.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Amagrafu okubuka phezu engeziwe:</strong> Bonisa ubuningi bamagrafu okubuka phezu amabili: igrafu eyinhloko yethrafikhi neyodwa eyengeziwe, njenge-CPU, ukubambezeleka noma esinye isixhumi. Hlunga ngohlobo lwegrafu kunciphisa ukukhetha. U-Engeza igrafu yokubuka phezu wengeza eyengeziwe; u-Shintsha amagrafu okubuka phezu uyayishintsha; u-Susa igrafu uyayisusa. Igrafu eyinhloko yethrafikhi, ithrafikhi ekaliwe nendawo yokuchofoza isixhumanisi kuhlala kungashintshiwe. Kumbukeli, ukubuka kuqala ngakunye kwe-Cacti kuvula igrafu yako egcwele uma kuchofozwa.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Izilungiselelo ezithuthukile:</strong> Izilawuli zokuzikhethela zokuhambisa amalebula ethrafikhi e-IN/OUT, ukuhlanganisa imithombo ekaliwe, ukushintsha indawo yokuchofoza nokufaka ama-URL ezithombe zokubuka phezu zokwezifiso. Izindawo zamalebula ethrafikhi zihambisa amabhokisi okusetshenziswa esixhumanisini, ngokuzimele ezindaweni zamazwana. U-Sebenzisa okuzenzakalelayo kwemephu ulandela Isitayela Semephu. Isixhumanisi sethrafikhi esijwayelekile ngokuvamile asidingi zinguquko lapha.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Ukuhlanganisa imithombo yethrafikhi:</strong> U-Engeza umthombo wethrafikhi wengeza esinye isixhumi kusamba semephu, ngokuhlukana kwe-IN ne-OUT. U-Susa umthombo ususa umthombo owengeziwe. Shintsha umthombo oyinhloko usebenzisa u-Sebenzisa isixhumi phezulu. Ithrafikhi ehlanganisiwe iqhathaniswa nomkhawulokudonsa olungiselelwe ukuze kubalwe ukusetshenziswa. Ayikho igrafu ehlanganisiwe ye-Cacti edalwa ngokuzenzakalelayo; dala igrafu ehlanganisiwe efanayo ku-Cacti bese ufaka ama-URL ayo okuchofoza nawokubuka phezu uma kudingeka. Izixhumanisi zemephu ezihlukene ngokuvamile zicace kakhudlwana ekuxhumaneni okuyinhloko nokusekelayo.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Imithombo nama-URL okufakwa mathupha:</strong> Ibhokisi lombhalo lomthombo lihlela uhlu oluphelele lwemithombo ekaliwe, kufaka phakathi umthombo oyinhloko. I-URL yendawo yokuchofoza ilawula lapho ukuchofoza isixhumanisi semephu kuya khona. I-URL eyinhloko yegrafu yokubuka phezu isetha ukubuka kuqala kokuqala; Ama-URL egrafu eyengeziwe amukela i-URL eyodwa yesithombe eyengeziwe. Lokhu okwengeziwe kuphinde kuphathwe ngaphansi kokuthi Amagrafu okubuka phezu engeziwe.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Lungisa kanye no-Ngokudlula ku:</strong> U-Lungisa ulungisa isakhiwo sesixhumanisi. U-Ngokudlula ku ukuvumela ukubeka iphuzu lokugoba emephini.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Hlela Ukucushwa Okuluhlaza:</strong> Hlela i-syntax yemephu eyisisekelo yezilungiselelo ezingaphezu kwaleli fomu.</p>"

